{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43594","headline":"游长安诸寺联句 长乐坊安国寺 题璘公院 · 段成式","name":"游长安诸寺联句 长乐坊安国寺 题璘公院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"静，虚。\n热际，安居。\n龛灯敛，印香除。\n东林宾客，西涧图书。\n檐外垂青豆，经中发白蕖。\n纵辩宗因衮衮，忘言理事如如。\n泉台定将入流否，邻笛足疑清梵余。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段成式","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43594.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43594","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}